              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Carter G. Phillips (Petitioner), according to Carter G. Phillips (Petitioner), retaliation claims under Title VII Section 704 have more than doubled in the past decade and now comprise over 30% of the EEOC docket."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Carter G. Phillips",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "3eac5e32b531afcce885fb908744b108385604524bddce553340aac490f8f419",
