          ],
          "text": "According to Respondent (Donald A. Donati), according to Respondent (Donald A. Donati), Burlington Northern reassigned Ms. White and removed her without pay for 37 days during Christmas, which constitutes discrimination under EEOC, plain\u2011language, and Sixth Circuit standards."
        },
        {
